  "description": "Unidentified monsters have taken over the metro lines of Seoul, bringing chaos to the city. In the 20 years since the monsters emerged, a system of hunters has been built in order to deal with the monster dungeons that have formed all over the city. One such hunter, Kang Cheol -- the Metro Hunter -- is on a journey to find and slay a monster he calls the “Master of Fire.” \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
